The per-gate workflow-file split (remedy (a)) was verified viable and not
taken: each split file needs its own clone and grammar build, a single-agent
runner serializes them, and a cron-file change is first validated up to
twelve hours later. The tripwire text in its four homes is re-pointed, not
struck. The pipeline body travels by FILE, not $(...): a subshell throws the
HTTP code away, and the first cut reported every refusal as HTTP 000.

